<title>GREECE: GREEK MIRAGE FIGHTER CRASHES, PILOT SAFE.</title>
<headline>GREEK MIRAGE FIGHTER CRASHES, PILOT SAFE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Greek Air Force Mirage 2000 crashed on Thursday south of the island of Andros but the pilot parachuted to safely, defence ministry officials said.</p>
<p>Radios said the plane was on a routine flight with one pilot aboard.</p>
<p>--Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
